{"id":"drv-ext-hr","type":"text","x":8484,"y":2332,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**MAX30102 HR driver (ext_hr)**\nStreams red/IR FIFO into…\n\nruns: ext task: FIFO every 120 ms with a lease, first background read +2 min after boot.\n\n`PARTIAL`\n[[Health and activity|Open note]]","color":"3"},
{"id":"drv-radio-admission","type":"text","x":8940,"y":2332,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Radio admission control**\nStarts or stops Wi-Fi and BLE from the saved…\n\nruns: Main loop, every pass (also with the screen off).\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Connectivity and voice|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"drv-ext-env","type":"text","x":9396,"y":2332,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**BME280 driver (ext_env)**\nForced-mode pressure/temperature/humidity…\n\nruns: ext task every 2 s, with no idle gate once present.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Utility apps|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"drv-battery","type":"text","x":9852,"y":2332,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Battery sampler and percent model**\n8 ADC reads per second, median, EMA 1/5,…\n\nruns: Triggered at 1 Hz from board-sense, screen on or off.\n\n`PARTIAL`\n[[Power and battery|Open note]]","color":"3"},
{"id":"drv-ext-gps","type":"text","x":10308,"y":2332,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**GNSS driver (ext_gps)**\nNMEA parser with baud probing; supplies fix,…\n\nruns: ext task while a getter or owner keeps it alive.\n\n`PARTIAL`\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]","color":"3"},
{"id":"drv-rtc","type":"text","x":10764,"y":2332,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**RTC trust and write-back**\nboard_restore_clock reads the PCF85063 at…\n\nruns: Boot once; rtc_maintain on every board-fs pass (100 ms), forced at shutdown.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Followup 1 - Time source, RTC trust and midnight rollover end to end|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"drv-hal-store","type":"text","x":11220,"y":2332,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**hal_store (NVS + SD routing)**\nBlob API over NVS namespace 'wos'. Only…\n\nruns: Called inline by the owner of each key (UI task or board-fs).\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|10 gaps]]\n[[Storage and persistence|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"drv-wifi","type":"text","x":11676,"y":2332,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Wi-Fi station, setup AP, HTTP server, SNTP**\nStation join with backoff, 600 s phone-setup…\n\nruns: wifi-settings task (100 ms) plus retry/AP timers.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|6 gaps]]\n[[Connectivity and voice|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"drv-usb-serial","type":"text","x":12132,"y":2332,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**USB serial CDC, framing and guard**\nNative USB Serial/JTAG link. LF framing (191…\n\nruns: Read by the cmd task every 50 ms.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|2 gaps]]\n[[Followup 5 - USB command to handler map and host protocol edge cases|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"drv-ble","type":"text","x":12588,"y":2332,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**BLE host, advertising, GATT and bonding**\nNimBLE stack: advertising, connection…\n\nruns: NimBLE host task plus the 100 ms ble_control_tick callout.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|8 gaps]]\n[[Followup 6 - Gadgetbridge inbound and outbound message audit and phone-link failure modes|Open note]]","color":"1"},
{"id":"drv-ext-lte","type":"text","x":13044,"y":2332,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**LTE modem driver (ext_lte)**\nAT scheduler: CSQ/CEREG/CREG/COPS about…\n\nruns: ext task, only while LTE is enabled or kept alive.\n\n`PARTIAL`\n[[Connectivity and voice|Open note]]","color":"3"},
{"id":"drv-ext-light","type":"text","x":13500,"y":2332,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**APDS-9960 driver (ext_light)**\nAmbient light and proximity readout for…\n\nruns: ext task about every 400 ms.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"drv-ext-haptic","type":"text","x":13956,"y":2332,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Haptic driver (ext_haptic)**\nPlays PWM vibration patterns and strength…\n\nruns: haptic esp_timer chain, per pattern segment.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"drv-ext-audio","type":"text","x":14412,"y":2332,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Audio driver (ext_audio)**\nI2S speaker/mic for Recorder WAVs (16 kHz…\n\nruns: exta (prio 3) 4 ms blocks and extf (prio 0) files, only while recording or playing.\n\n`PARTIAL`\n[[Utility apps|Open note]]","color":"3"},
{"id":"drv-ext-hal","type":"text","x":14868,"y":2332,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Strap HAL contract and presence mask**\nhal_ext_* contract shared by all strap…\n\nruns: Serviced by the ext task, wakes at most every 50 ms.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|9 gaps]]\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"drv-sleep-protocol","type":"text","x":15324,"y":2332,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Sleep park protocol**\nAt shutdown the board asks each strap module…\n\nruns: Shutdown path only.\n\n`PARTIAL`\n[[Power and battery|Open note]]","color":"3"},
{"id":"drv-imu-hal","type":"text","x":15780,"y":2332,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**IMU recorder HAL (imu_hal.c)**\nCreates the imu-rate timer and the imu-…\n\nruns: Only while a manual recording runs.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Sports and workouts|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"drv-batt-log","type":"text","x":16236,"y":2332,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**BLE battery history ring**\nhal_batt_log_tick fills a 1440-entry mV ring…\n\nruns: Never runs.\n\n`DEAD-CODE`\n[[Power and battery|Open note]]","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"task-ui","type":"text","x":4152,"y":3072,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**main / app_main UI loop**\nBoot, power-state machine, serial command…\n\nruns: core 0, prio 1, 8192 B. ON about 60 Hz (40 Hz authored); AOD/SENSOR 1 Hz frames; OFF 50 Hz loop, no frames.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|3 gaps]]\n[[Engine and scheduling|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"task-touch","type":"text","x":4608,"y":3072,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**touch task**\nPolls the FT3168 and pushes points into a…\n\nruns: core 1, prio 5. 10 ms ON, 40 ms (25 Hz) otherwise; keeps polling screen-off.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"task-dotbake","type":"text","x":5064,"y":3072,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**dotbake task**\nBoot-time prebake of dot-matrix masks and…\n\nruns: core 1, prio 1, 3 KB. Boot only.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Followup 4 - Uncovered built files- blur pipeline, orrery shade, fonts|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"task-board-fs","type":"text","x":5520,"y":3072,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**board-fs task**\nDevice retry, SD mount retry, pedometer NVS…\n\nruns: prio 1, 4 KB. 100 ms loop, always on.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|1 gap]]\n[[Storage and persistence|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"task-imu-sample","type":"text","x":5976,"y":3072,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**imu-sample task**\nReads IMU samples on each imu-rate timer…\n\nruns: prio 3. 25/50/100 Hz, only while recording.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Sports and workouts|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"task-imu-write","type":"text","x":6432,"y":3072,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**imu-write task**\nDrains the recorder queue to…\n\nruns: prio 1, 6 KB. 20 ms loop, only while recording.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Sports and workouts|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"task-flush","type":"text","x":6888,"y":3072,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**flush task**\nTakes 16-row stripe jobs, rotates them CCW…\n\nruns: core 1, prio 4, 3 KB, queue depth 3. Per dirty stripe; idle when nothing changes.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|2 gaps]]\n[[Rendering pipeline|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"task-sports-sd","type":"text","x":7344,"y":3072,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**sports_sd task**\nSingle SD writer for the sports journal:…\n\nruns: prio 1, 4 KB PSRAM, no affinity. 1 s drain, 512-record batch.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Sports and workouts|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"task-ext","type":"text","x":7800,"y":3072,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**ext task (strap service)**\nServices every present strap driver in turn…\n\nruns: prio 0, 4 KB PSRAM, unpinned. Wakes at most every 50 ms; some modules run with the screen off.\n\n`PARTIAL`\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]","color":"3"},
{"id":"task-workout-sd","type":"text","x":8256,"y":3072,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**workout_sd task**\nWrites the workout session image as…\n\nruns: prio 2, 6144 B. 500 ms loop; checkpoint every 30 s while running.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Sports and workouts|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"task-board-sense","type":"text","x":8712,"y":3072,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**board-sense task**\nIMU loop (3 reads per cycle, about 150/s)…\n\nruns: prio 2, 4 KB static, no affinity. 20 ms cycle, always on, screen off included.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|6 gaps]]\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]","color":"1"},
{"id":"task-track-save","type":"text","x":9168,"y":3072,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**track_save task**\nOne-shot: writes the frozen GPS point array…\n\nruns: prio 1, 4 KB. One shot per track stop.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Utility apps|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"task-memo-scan","type":"text","x":9624,"y":3072,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**memo_scan task**\nOne-shot scan of the memo folder that builds…\n\nruns: prio 1, 4 KB. One shot per scan.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Utility apps|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"task-asset-read","type":"text","x":10080,"y":3072,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**asset-read task**\nReads asset files from SD off the UI thread…\n\nruns: prio 1. On demand from the orrery card poll.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Rendering pipeline|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"task-wifi-settings","type":"text","x":10536,"y":3072,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**wifi-settings task**\nWorker for scans, joins and the setup AP;…\n\nruns: prio 2, 6144 B. 100 ms loop.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Connectivity and voice|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"task-weather","type":"text","x":10992,"y":3072,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**weather task**\nFetches Open-Meteo when Wi-Fi is up and a…\n\nruns: prio 2, 8 KB. 1 s poll; fetch every 1800 s ok, 60 s on failure, 10 s minimum gap.\n\n`PARTIAL`\n[[Connectivity and voice|Open note]]","color":"3"},
{"id":"task-nimble-host","type":"text","x":11448,"y":3072,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**nimble_host task**\nNimBLE host: GATT, NUS RX assembly into the…\n\nruns: core 0, prio configMAX_PRIORITIES-4. Event driven.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Connectivity and voice|Open note]]","color":"4"},
{"id":"task-exta","type":"text","x":11904,"y":3072,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**exta audio task**\nPumps I2S PCM in and out for recording and…\n\nruns: prio 3, 4 KB. 4 ms blocks while needed.\n\n`PARTIAL`\n[[Utility apps|Open note]]","color":"3"},
